                "text": "Vulnerability GO-2026-5028\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: golang.org/x/net\nVersion: v0.52.0\nFix Version: 0.55.0\nType: go-module\nLocation: /api/go.mod\nData Namespace: govulndb:language:go\nLink: [GO-2026-5028](https://go.dev/cl/781702)",
